<main class="gtm" id="main">

  <!-- ══ the first screen ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HEADER MODULE — the brief's 3_4 shot, in Alex's wider cut
       (img/3_4-2400.jpg, 23 Sep 2026).
       HERO1 is withdrawn (Alex, 23 Sep 2026): every picture on this page is
       the one the copy deck names for its module. The frame carries no type
       of its own, so the page's own H1 is set here. Everything the brief asks to be above
       the fold is: the name, the subhead, the three admission facts and
       the route to register.

       The picture is anchored to the top of the first screen and fills its
       width; the fold takes only the empty floor at the far end of the
       hall. Geometry and the wide-short fallback: css/gtm.css. -->
  <section class="hero">
    <figure class="hero__frame">
      <img src="img/3_4-2400.jpg"
           srcset="img/3_4-hero-800.webp 800w, img/3_4-hero-1200.webp 1200w, img/3_4-hero-1600.webp 1600w, img/3_4-hero-1920.webp 1920w"
           sizes="(max-width: 60rem) 120vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1080" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
           alt="Ferrari 296 GT Modificata from the front three-quarter, lit in a dark hall.">
    </figure>

    <div class="hero__type">
      <h1 class="h1">Ferrari 296 GT Modificata</h1>
      <p class="lead">The most extreme model yet created for the Club Competizioni GT program</p>
      <p class="micro">Track use only &nbsp;·&nbsp; Club Competizioni GT &nbsp;·&nbsp; Produced in exceptionally limited numbers</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="#register">Register your interest</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ 1 · the evolution ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <figure class="frame frame--no-foot reveal">
    <img src="img/details_005-2400.jpg"
         srcset="img/details_005-cut-800.webp 800w, img/details_005-cut-1200.webp 1200w, img/details_005-cut-1600.webp 1600w, img/details_005-cut-1920.webp 1920w"
         sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
         alt="The 296 GT Modificata from above and behind, MODIFICATA lettering down the rear wing.">
    <p class="marker action frame__marker"><span>1</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span>The evolution</span></p>
  </figure>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="evo-h">
    <div class="block__in">
      <h2 class="h2 slide" id="evo-h">The most extreme evolution of the 296 GT3 Evo</h2>
      <div class="copy slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-7)">
        <p class="body">The 296 GT Modificata retains the architecture and unmistakable racing pedigree of the 296 GT3 Evo, freed from the regulatory constraints that govern its competition counterpart. The result is a special version of an existing model engineered to realize the platform&rsquo;s full potential, pushing technology, performance, and driving pleasure to new heights.</p>
        <p class="body">Created exclusively for the Club Competizioni GT program and produced in exceptionally limited numbers, the 296 GT Modificata offers an uncompromising expression of Ferrari performance, conceived for the pure exhilaration of non-competitive track driving.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ 2 · the power unit ══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <figure class="frame frame--bare reveal">
    <img src="img/motore_ambientato-2400.jpg"
         srcset="img/motore_ambientato-cut-800.webp 800w, img/motore_ambientato-cut-1200.webp 1200w, img/motore_ambientato-cut-1600.webp 1600w, img/motore_ambientato-cut-1920.webp 1920w"
         sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
         alt="The 120-degree twin-turbo V6 of the 296 GT Modificata, standing alone on the floor of the hall.">
    <p class="marker action frame__marker"><span>2</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span>The power unit</span></p>
  </figure>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="unit-h">
    <div class="block__in">
      <h2 class="h2 slide" id="unit-h">730 HP V6</h2>
      <div class="copy slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-7)">
        <p class="body">The 296 GT Modificata is powered by the latest iteration of the rear-mid mounted 120&deg; twin-turbo V6 architecture that has successfully powered both Ferrari production and race models. Developed unfettered by the constraints imposed by motorsports or technical regulations, the 2,992 cc engine produces 730 cv&mdash;130 cv more than the rules-restricted 296 GT3 Evo.</p>
        <p class="body">Extensive development of the engine&rsquo;s key components and systems, including its rotating assembly, camshafts, intake system, intercoolers and turbochargers, enables unprecedented performance for a Ferrari GT model. With a benchmark specific output of 244 cv/l, power is delivered seamlessly and progressively through a six-speed sequential gearbox with dedicated ratios, contributing to a top speed of over 300 km/h.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="facts slide">
        <div><dt class="micro">Maximum power</dt><dd>730 cv</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="micro">Specific output</dt><dd>244 cv/l</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="micro">Versus 296 GT3 Evo</dt><dd>+130 cv</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ 3 · aerodynamics ════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="pin">
    <figure class="frame frame--pin reveal">
      <img src="img/front-2400.jpg"
           srcset="img/front-cut-800.webp 800w, img/front-cut-1200.webp 1200w, img/front-cut-1600.webp 1600w, img/front-cut-1920.webp 1920w"
           sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
           alt="Ferrari 296 GT Modificata, front elevation: the new hood, its vents and the slotted splitter.">
      <p class="marker action frame__marker"><span>3</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span>Aerodynamics</span></p>
    </figure>

    <section class="block" aria-labelledby="aero-h">
      <div class="block__in">
        <h2 class="h2 slide" id="aero-h">Engineered for extreme performance</h2>
        <div class="copy slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-7)">
          <p class="body">To complement the increase in power, the 296 GT Modificata&rsquo;s aerodynamics and cooling systems were re-engineered to meet the car&rsquo;s greater performance demands. A new front hood maximizes heat dissipation, while revised vents and a dedicated airflow-management vane optimize thermal management during intensive track use.</p>
          <p class="body">An all-new slotted front splitter improves underfloor efficiency, generating additional downforce and enhancing high-speed stability. At the rear, a newly developed wing improves aerodynamic efficiency while preserving the car&rsquo;s optimal balance and predictable dynamic behavior.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ 4 · the cabin ═════════════════════════════════════════════════
       MODULE 5 · INTERIOR — the brief's 296GTM_interni_05. Set as every
       other chapter is: the frame, then the words. -->
  <figure class="frame reveal">
    <img src="img/interni_05-2400.webp"
         srcset="img/interni_05-800.webp 800w, img/interni_05-1200.webp 1200w, img/interni_05-1600.webp 1600w, img/interni_05-2400.webp 2400w, img/interni_05-3200.webp 3200w"
         sizes="100vw" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
         alt="Two racing seats with red and yellow Sabelt harnesses inside the 296 GT Modificata.">
    <p class="marker action frame__marker"><span>4</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span>The cabin</span></p>
  </figure>

  <section class="block" id="cabin" aria-labelledby="cabin-h">
    <div class="block__in">
      <h2 class="h2 slide" id="cabin-h">Born for two</h2>
      <div class="copy slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-7)">
        <p class="body">The cabin was developed around the driver while accommodating a passenger without compromising safety or functionality. Changes to the roll cage made it possible to install a second seat, complemented by a dedicated footrest and integrated intercom system.</p>
        <p class="body">The two-seat configuration allows a coach to accompany the driver and provide real-time feedback throughout each session. This makes the process of refining technique and improving performance more effective, while creating a shared and more rewarding track experience.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ 5 · braking ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <div class="pin">
    <figure class="frame frame--pin reveal">
      <img src="img/side-2400.webp"
           srcset="img/side-800.webp 800w, img/side-1200.webp 1200w, img/side-1600.webp 1600w, img/side-2400.webp 2400w, img/side-3200.webp 3200w"
           sizes="100vw" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
           alt="Ferrari 296 GT Modificata, side elevation.">
      <p class="marker action frame__marker"><span>5</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span>Braking</span></p>
    </figure>

    <section class="block" aria-labelledby="brakes-h">
      <div class="block__in">
        <h2 class="h2 slide" id="brakes-h">Performance with complete confidence</h2>
        <div class="copy slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-7)">
          <p class="body">New front brake discs, an additional air intake and an all-new cooling duct improve the braking system&rsquo;s thermal management, providing more consistent performance and greater reliability.</p>
          <p class="body">The Motorsport ABS system delivers stable, predictable braking with precise modulation, making the car&rsquo;s performance more accessible to drivers with varying levels of track experience.</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="facts slide">
          <div><dt class="micro">Front discs</dt><dd>400 &times; 26 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="micro">Rear discs</dt><dd>332 &times; 32 mm</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ 6 · equipment and options ══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <figure class="frame reveal">
    <img src="img/back-2400.webp"
         srcset="img/back-800.webp 800w, img/back-1200.webp 1200w, img/back-1600.webp 1600w, img/back-2400.webp 2400w, img/back-3200.webp 3200w"
         sizes="100vw" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
         alt="Ferrari 296 GT Modificata seen from the rear three-quarter.">
    <p class="marker action frame__marker"><span>6</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span>Equipment and options</span></p>
  </figure>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="options-h">
    <div class="block__in">
      <h2 class="h2 slide" id="options-h">Limitless possibilities</h2>
      <div class="copy slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-7)">
        <p class="body">The 296 GT Modificata combines standard equipment engineered to maximize effectiveness on track with a range of options offering extensive scope for personalization. The result balances function, exclusivity, and freedom of expression, allowing each owner to create a truly individual car.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ 7 · the programme — the arrival, scrubbed by the scroll ═══════
       ONE-CONTINUOUS-LOCKED-OFF-TOP-DOWN-SHOT.mp4, laid out as 72 frames in
       img/arrival/ (Alex, 23 Sep 2026 — in place of the brief's
       details_v06_002 for this module). The camera never moves: the floor
       waits under the words, the car rolls in from the top and stops, and
       its lights come on. The scroll is the transport — stop, and the
       picture stops; go back, and the car backs out.

       Without the script, or with reduced motion, the chapter is the last
       frame and the words over it: the arrival already made. -->
  <section class="scrub" id="programme" aria-labelledby="prog-h">
    <div class="scrub__stage">
      <div class="scrub__media">
        <img class="scrub__poster" src="img/arrival/f-071.webp" width="1600" height="907" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
             alt="The 296 GT Modificata from directly above, arrived on the floor with its headlights lit.">
        <canvas class="scrub__canvas" width="1600" height="907" aria-hidden="true"
                data-frames="img/arrival/f-" data-count="72"></canvas>
      </div>
      <p class="marker action frame__marker"><span>7</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span>The programme</span></p>
      <div class="scrub__type">
        <h2 class="h2" id="prog-h">Created for the racetrack</h2>
        <div class="copy" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-7)">
          <p class="body">Conceived for non-competitive track use, the Ferrari 296 GT Modificata was created for the Club Competizioni GT program, offering clients the opportunity to develop their driving potential in an exclusive setting.</p>
          <p class="body">The car is intended exclusively for track-day use and participation in Ferrari Club Competizioni GT events. This members-only program gives Ferrari clients access to some of the world&rsquo;s most prestigious circuits. Purchase of the 296 GT Modificata includes two years, or 12 rounds, of participation, allowing owners to experience the car across top global circuits with distinct layouts and technical characteristics.</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt class="micro">Included</dt><dd>2 years</dd></div>
          <div><dt class="micro">Rounds</dt><dd>12</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ 8 · the specification ═══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="spec-h">
    <div class="block__in">
      <p class="marker action slide"><span>8</span><span class="marker__rule"></span><span id="spec-h">Technical specifications</span></p>
      <div class="spec" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-10)">
        <div>
          <section class="spec__group" aria-labelledby="spec-engine">
            <span class="spec__label micro" id="spec-engine">Engine</span>
            <dl class="spec__rows">
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Type</dt><dd>2,992 cc turbocharged 120&deg; V6</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Bore / stroke</dt><dd>88 &times; 82 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Maximum power</dt><dd>730 cv (537 kW) @ 7,500 rpm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Maximum torque</dt><dd>800 Nm @ 5,000 rpm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Specific output</dt><dd>244 cv/l (179 kW/l)</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Compression ratio</dt><dd>9.4:1</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </section>
          <section class="spec__group" aria-labelledby="spec-trans">
            <span class="spec__label micro" id="spec-trans">Transmission and gearbox</span>
            <dl class="spec__rows">
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Gearbox</dt><dd>Transverse six-speed sequential</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Clutch</dt><dd>Carbon</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </section>
          <section class="spec__group" aria-labelledby="spec-elec">
            <span class="spec__label micro" id="spec-elec">Electronic control systems</span>
            <dl class="spec__rows">
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">TC</dt><dd>Traction control</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">DDU</dt><dd>Driving information display</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </section>
        </div>
        <div>
          <section class="spec__group" aria-labelledby="spec-dims">
            <span class="spec__label micro" id="spec-dims">Weights and dimensions</span>
            <dl class="spec__rows">
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Length</dt><dd>5,033 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Width with mirrors</dt><dd>2,230 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Width without mirrors</dt><dd>2,050 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Height</dt><dd>1,082 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Wheelbase</dt><dd>2,660 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Front track</dt><dd>1,726 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Rear track</dt><dd>1,714 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Dry weight</dt><dd>1,330 kg</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Fuel tank</dt><dd>120 l</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </section>
          <section class="spec__group" aria-labelledby="spec-tires">
            <span class="spec__label micro" id="spec-tires">Tires</span>
            <dl class="spec__rows">
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Front</dt><dd>325/680 R18</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Rear</dt><dd>325/705 R18</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </section>
          <section class="spec__group" aria-labelledby="spec-brakes">
            <span class="spec__label micro" id="spec-brakes">Brakes</span>
            <dl class="spec__rows">
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Front discs</dt><dd>400 &times; 26 mm</dd></div>
              <div class="spec__row"><dt class="micro">Rear discs</dt><dd>332 &times; 32 mm</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ the close ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="block" id="register" aria-labelledby="close-h">
    <div class="block__in">
      <p class="micro slide">{{DEALER}}</p>
      <h2 class="h2 slide" id="close-h" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-4)">Ferrari 296 GT Modificata</h2>
      <div class="copy slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-6)">
        <p class="body">The 296 GT Modificata is offered exclusively through the Club Competizioni GT program, for track use only. Speak to the team about availability and the steps to join.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- PENDING · each dealer's own general Inquire lead form; no URL was
           supplied and none is invented here. -->
      <p class="slide" style="margin-block-start: var(--s-9)"><a class="btn" href="#" data-inquire>Register your interest</a></p>
